<title>USA: Air Express International Q1 diluted shr up.</title>
<headline>Air Express International Q1 diluted shr up.</headline>
<dateline>DARIEN, Conn 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended March 31</p>
<p>	 1997			 1996</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.37		    $0.31</p>
<p> Net		 8,539		    6,147</p>
<p> Revs		351,155		  294,787</p>
<p> Avg Shrs	  23,260		   22,239</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Company full name is Air Express International Corp.</p>
<p>The company said the quarter benefited from the elimination of about $1,100,000 of interest expense associated with convertible subordinated debentures which were converted into AEI common stock on or before July 8.</p>
